    <li>Fix common mobile device problems (sync issues, activation locks, carrier settings)</li>
    <li>Troubleshoot printer issues (driver conflicts, paper jams, network printer discovery)</li>
    <li>Use diagnostic tools (multimeter, POST card, event viewer, ipconfig/ifconfig, ping, nslookup)</li>
  </ul>

